Third-party components
----------------------
This project has no runtime dependencies and vendors no third-party code.
Every file under src/ was written for this repository.

forksync drives the GitHub CLI (https://cli.github.com/), which is a separate
program under its own license. forksync links no part of it: it is invoked as
a subprocess and the CLI is not redistributed here. The same is true of the
Python interpreter it runs on, under the Python Software Foundation License.

